<para>
  Redo a previously <link
  linkend="MenuItem-OOF.NodeSelection.Undo">undone</link> &elem;
  selection in the given <varname>skeleton</varname>.  Undone
  selections can be redone only if no new selections have been made
  since the time of the last <link
  linkend="MenuItem-OOF.NodeSelection.Undo"><command>Undo</command></link>.
</para>
<para>
  This command is equivalent to <xref
  linkend="MenuItem-OOF.Graphics_n.Toolbox.Select_Element.Redo"/>,
  which performs the same task from the <link
  linkend="Section-Graphics-SkeletonSelection">Skeleton
  Selection</link> toolbox in the Graphics window.
</para>


